[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]

; folded is the one variable: FoldedContainer (folded = true) hides its child and sizes
; to its title bar alone, while UnfoldedContainer (folded = false) shows its child, fit
; below the title bar via NOTIFICATION_SORT_CHILDREN's fit_child_in_rect. Both carry a
; Label child of the same shape, so a layout regression in either state is visible
; against the other. FoldedContainer keeps FoldableContainer's other own properties at
; valid non-default values (title_alignment, title_position, title_text_overrun_behavior,
; foldable_group); UnfoldedContainer stays at their defaults.

